{"id":"6b350e567d372da0","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-unstable-sentence.md","title":"不稳定句子","display":"df-unstable-sentence — 不稳定句子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-unstable-sentence","aliases":["91-df-unstable-sentence","91-df-unstable"],"display":"df-unstable-sentence — 不稳定句子","depends_on":["[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","[[91-df-truth-teller]]","[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-unstable-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-unstable-sentence</span><span>91-df-unstable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unstable-sentence — 不稳定句子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3a19d5715745463a\" href=\"?note=3a19d5715745463a\" title=\"91-df-stable-sentence\">91-df-stable-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"724d38bcb2abeb43\" href=\"?note=724d38bcb2abeb43\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller\">91-df-truth-teller</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-unstable-sentence-—-不稳定句子-$\\mathrm{Unstable}$\">df-unstable-sentence — 不稳定句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Unstable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Unstable}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (跳跃算子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)=\\{\\Gamma\\mid J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)=\\{\\Gamma\\mid J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\}\\)</span> (一致固定点类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\">\\(v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\\)</span>\n(固定点诱导的真值函数族)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unstable\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Unstable}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\bigl(v_{\\Gamma_1}(\\varphi)\\ne v_{\\Gamma_2}(\\varphi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unstable\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Unstable}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\bigl(v_{\\Gamma_1}(\\varphi)\\ne v_{\\Gamma_2}(\\varphi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Unstable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Unstable}\\)</span> : 不稳定句子谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_{\\Gamma_1}(\\varphi) \\neq v_{\\Gamma_2}(\\varphi)\">\\(v_{\\Gamma_1}(\\varphi) \\neq v_{\\Gamma_2}(\\varphi)\\)</span> : 真值在不同固定点中不同</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不稳定句子的含义：\n不稳定句子在两个一致固定点中取不同真值。它描述固定点选择依赖性，\n不是修正理论中“沿一个序列振荡”的概念。</p>\n<p>不稳定句子的类型：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>不同固定点中的真值</th>\n<th>典型例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>可变真值</td>\n<td>在两个固定点中的值不同</td>\n<td>真理陈述者 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定间隙</td>\n<td>在所有固定点中均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td>说谎者 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>（不是不稳定句）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>说谎者与真理陈述者的区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>说谎者<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>：稳定间隙（并非&quot;不稳定&quot;，而是&quot;始终间隙&quot;)</li>\n<li>真理陈述者<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>：不稳定（可真可假）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不稳定句子与间隙句子的关系：\n若最小固定点赋给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 未定义值，而某个更大固定点赋给它确定值，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 不稳定；定义本身不应把“不属于某一个外延”误当作充分条件。</p>\n<p>不稳定句子在真理理论中的处理：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>不稳定句子处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>KF 预期模型</td>\n<td>选定不同固定点时可能给出不同值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极小固定点语义</td>\n<td>常把真理陈述者留为间隙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经典对象理论</td>\n<td>不能仅由对象层二值性消除元语义中的固定点差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>不稳定句子的理论意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>展示固定点的多样性</li>\n<li>区分&quot;悖论&quot;与&quot;不确定&quot;</li>\n<li>真理陈述者是不稳定性的关键案例</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-unstable-sentence-—-不稳定句子-$\\mathrm{Unstable}$","text":"df-unstable-sentence — 不稳定句子 $\\mathrm{Unstable}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-stable-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3a19d5715745463a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-stable-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-teller","status":"resolved","id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Unstable}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)=\\{\\Gamma\\mid J(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unstable\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Unstable}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\exists\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\bigl(v_{\\Gamma_1}(\\varphi)\\ne v_{\\Gamma_2}(\\varphi)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Unstable}","display":false},{"tex":"v_{\\Gamma_1}(\\varphi) \\neq v_{\\Gamma_2}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":2449,"backlinks":[{"id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da74a4922b7a5745","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"525f810b84880b72","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-unstable-sentence]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-unstable-sentence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositi